# The C/C++ compile's rules: copts.bzl (what GN adds per target: FLUTTER_COPTS,
# the local defines), sanitizers.bzl (the sanitizer attributes and the
# launcher lines a test gets), and the Apple sources' rules -- objc_library.bzl
# (flutter_objc_library, a GN target's .m/.mm files), swift_library.bzl
# (flutter_swift_library, a source_set of .swift files through GN's
# swiftc.py) and apple.bzl (what they and the toolchains agree on).

package(default_visibility = ["//visibility:public"])
